      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The monster we're tracking — its whereabouts\r\nremain unknown for now. But — its tracks\r\nhave already been found.",
        "Jp" : "今追っている魔物だけど\r\n現状、どこにいるのかわかってないんだ\r\nだけど――その\"痕跡\"はすでに発見してる"
