      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If you follow the traces, you'll overtake them\r\nsoon enough. Might I ask you to handle the\r\npursuit? Truth be told, an old wound still pains\r\nme, and I feared that crossing blades with\r\nmonsters would be too great a burden.",
        "Jp" : "\"痕跡\"を辿っていけば、いつか追い付けるはずだよ\r\n追跡を頼んでもいいかな\r\n実は、前に負傷した傷跡が痛むから\r\n魔物と交戦するのは荷が重いと思ってたんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 610462,
      "MsgType" : 1,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
